      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (a), by inserting after the words “Fire Officers” the words “and Auxiliary Fire Officers”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/2/eng@/~cl_13__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/2/eng@/~cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph: “(b) for the purpose of— (i) procuring comforts, convenience and other benefits, which are not chargeable to public revenue, for Fire Officer, former Fire Officer who have retired on pension, gratuity or other allowance or persons who are partially or wholly depended on the deceased Fire Officer or former Fire Officer at the time of their death; or (ii) granting loans to the Fire Officer.”. New section 50a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/2/eng@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/2/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 50 the following section: “Personation as Fire Officer, Auxiliary Fire Officer and Voluntary Fire Officer 50a. Any person not being a Fire Officer, Auxiliary Fire Officer or Voluntary Fire Officer who— (a) pretends to be a Fire Officer, Auxiliary Fire Officer or Voluntary Fire Officer knowing that he is not; (b) falsely personates as a Fire Officer, Auxiliary Fire Officer or Voluntary Fire Officer; (c) in such assumed character does or attempts to do any act under colour of being a Fire Officer, Auxiliary Fire Officer or Voluntary Fire Officer; or (d) misuses the name, logo, special mark or any other mark of the Fire Officer, Auxiliary Fire Officer or Voluntary Fire Officer, commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both.”. Amendment of section 53"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/2/eng@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/2/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 53 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “Fire Officer or Auxiliary Fire Officer,” the words “Fire Officer, Auxiliary Fire Officer or Voluntary Fire Officer,”. New section 58a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/2/eng@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
